PRIOR SUMMARY:

NEW EVENTS:
[e00001] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Hey Jon! Good to see you. What's up? Anything new?

[e00002] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Hey Gina! Good to see you too. Lost my job as a banker yesterday, so I'm gonna take a shot at starting my own business.

[e00003] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Sorry about your job Jon, but starting your own business sounds awesome! Unfortunately, I also lost my job at Door Dash this month. What business are you thinking of?

[e00004] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Sorry to hear that! I'm starting a dance studio 'cause I'm passionate about dancing and it'd be great to share it with others.

[e00005] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
That's cool, Jon! What got you into this biz?

[e00006] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
I've been into dancing since I was a kid and it's been my passion and escape. I wanna start a dance studio so I can teach others the joy that dancing brings me.

[e00007] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow Jon, same here! Dance is pretty much my go-to for stress relief. Got any fave styles?

[e00008] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Cool, Gina! I love all dances, but contemporary is my top pick. It's so expressive and powerful! What's your fave?

[e00009] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Yeah, me too! Contemporary dance is so expressive and graceful - it really speaks to me.

[e00010] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, great idea! Let's go to a dance class, it'll be so much fun!

[e00011] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Yeah! Let's explore some new dance moves. We should plan a dance session soon!

[e00012] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Yeah definitely! Wanna see my moves next Fri? Can't wait!

[e00013] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Sounds great, Jon! Next Friday works. Let's boogie!

[e00014] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, I'm excited too! This is gonna be great! [Public image caption: a photography of a man in a suit is performing a dance]

[e00015] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow! What did you get?

[e00016] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Woah, that pic's from when my dance crew took home first in a local comp last year. It was amazing up on that stage! I'm super keen to spread that intensity with other peeps. Gina, you ever been in any dance comps or shows?

[e00017] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
I used to compete in a few dance competitions and shows - my fav memory was when my team won first place at a regionals at age fifteen. It was an awesome feeling of accomplishment! [Public image caption: a photography of a couple of people standing next to each other]

[e00018] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow! Winning first place is amazing! What dance were you doing?

[e00019] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Thanks! We just did a contemporary piece called "Finding Freedom." It was really emotional and powerful. [Public image caption: a photo of a large open porch with a fireplace and a view of the water]

[e00020] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, that must've been great! Check my ideal dance studio by the water. [Public image caption: a photography of a room with a view of the ocean and a few yoga mats]

[e00021] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Cool setup! Man, you can't deny that view! Got time to rehearse with a biz and a new store?

[e00022] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Hopefully, we will find a place like this that will inspire us!

[e00023] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, it looks great! What dances do you practice? Got any projects planned?

[e00024] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Thanks! I rehearsed with a small group of dancers after work. We do all kinds of dances, from contemporary to hip-hop. We've got some cool projects in the works. Finishing up choreography to perform at a nearby festival next month. Can't wait! [Public image caption: a photo of a group of dancers in white dresses on a stage]

[e00025] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, it looks awesome! Are they yours at the festival? They're so graceful!

[e00026] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Yeah, they're the ones performing at the festival! They've been practicing hard and will definitely impress with their grace and skill.

[e00027] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, they look great! Can't wait to see them rock the festival. Gonna be awesome!

[e00028] time=4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Yeah, awesome! Glad to be part of it.

[e00029] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Hey Jon! Long time no see! Things have been hectic lately. I just launched an ad campaign for my clothing store in hopes of growing the business. Starting my own store and taking risks is both scary and rewarding. I'm excited to see where it takes me! [Public image caption: a photo of a clothing store with a variety of clothes on display]

[e00030] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Hey Gina! Whoa, your store looks great! All your hard work really paid off - congrats! Must be awesome to see your stuff on display.

[e00031] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Thanks a bunch! It's awesome seeing my vision happen. How's the dance studio going? Did you find the right spot?

[e00032] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Hey Gina! Thanks for asking. I'm on the hunt for the ideal spot for my dance studio and it's been quite a journey! I've been looking at different places and picturing how the space would look. I even found a place with great natural light! Oh, I've been to Paris yesterday! It was sooo cool. [Public image caption: a photo of a bathroom with a blue floor and a pink wall]

[e00033] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, nice spot! Where is it? Got any other features you want to think about before you decide? Paris?! That is really great Jon! Never had a chance to visit it. Been only to Rome once.

[e00034] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
It's downtown which is awesome cuz it's easy to get to. Plus the natural light! Gotta check the size & floor quality too. We need a good dance floor with enough bounce for me & my students to dance safely.

[e00035] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Definitely! Dance floors help avoid injuries and make dancing more enjoyable. You thinking about it is great. Any particular type of flooring you like?

[e00036] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Yeah, good flooring's crucial. I'm after Marley flooring, which is what dance studios usually use. It's great 'cause it's grippy but still lets you move, plus it's tough and easy to keep clean.

[e00037] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Sounds great! Marley's perfect; it's got the right amount of grip and movement. Can't wait to see your dance studio done!

[e00038] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Yeah, can't wait to see it done! Looking for the right place and getting everything ready has been a mix of exciting and nerve-wracking, but I'm determined to make it work. It'll be worth it!

[e00039] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Believe in yourself, Jon! The process may be tough, but you got this. Push through and it'll be worth it. Don't forget to take breaks and dance it out when you need to destress!

[e00040] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Glad I have you in my corner! Gotta make time to dance and vent, that's for sure. We'll make it through this - hang in there!

[e00041] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Thanks, Jon! Appreciate your support!

[e00042] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Let's keep going and chase our dreams!

[e00043] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Yeah! We've done so much, and there's nothing but good stuff coming. Let's keep going after our goals and making them happen.

[e00044] time=2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Success is almost here. We got this!

[e00045] time=12:48 am on 1 February, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Hey Gina, hope you're doing ok! Still following my passion for dance. It's been bumpy, but I'm determined to make it work. I'm still searching for a place to open my dance studio.

[e00046] time=12:48 am on 1 February, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Hi Jon! So happy you're pushing forward with dancing! Inspiring 💪 I emailed some wholesalers and one replied and said yes today! I'm over the moon because now I can expand my clothing store and get closer to my customers. Check it out - here's a pic! [Public image caption: a photography of a shopping mall with a glass entrance and a sign]

[e00047] time=12:48 am on 1 February, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, Gina! You found the perfect spot for your store. Way to go, hard work's paying off! [Public image caption: a photo of a room with a mirror and a wooden floor]

[e00048] time=12:48 am on 1 February, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Thanks! Glad you like it. Yeah, it's a great spot. Here's a peek at the space I designed. Cozy and inviting - perfect for customers to check out all the trendy pieces. [Public image caption: a photography of a clothing store with a lot of clothes on display]

[e00049] time=12:48 am on 1 February, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, it looks great! Must've taken you ages to design it. What made you pick out the furniture and decor?

[e00050] time=12:48 am on 1 February, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Thanks! It took a bit of time but I wanted to make the place look like my own style and make my customers feel cozy. I chose furniture that looks great and is comfy too. The chandelier adds a nice glam feel while matching the style of the store.

[e00051] time=12:48 am on 1 February, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Your store looks great - your customers will be so comfy.

[e00052] time=12:48 am on 1 February, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Thanks! Making my spot comfortable and inviting for my customers is key. I want 'em to feel like they're in a cool oasis. Just creating an experience that'll make 'em wanna come back.

[e00053] time=12:48 am on 1 February, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
That's a great goal! Creating a special experience for customers is the key to making them feel welcome and coming back. I think you can create that space you're imagining.

[e00054] time=12:48 am on 1 February, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Thanks. Your support means a lot. I'm sure with my hard work and effort, I can make a special shopping experience for my customers. It's tough but I'm up for the challenge!

[e00055] time=12:48 am on 1 February, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
I'm always here to support you! Go create something awesome with your store. Keep it up!

[e00056] time=12:48 am on 1 February, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Thanks, Jon! I'll try my best. You're gonna do great with your dance studio, just keep going and stay positive! We'll get through this!

[e00057] time=12:48 am on 1 February, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Thanks! Your words mean a lot. I'm staying positive and pushing forward. We've put our hearts into our dreams and I'm sure we'll make it.

[e00058] time=12:48 am on 1 February, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Sure thing, Jon! Stay motivated and keep going. Hard work pays off eventually. We can do this!

[e00059] time=10:43 am on 4 February, 2023 speaker=Jon type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Hey Gina! What's up? How's the store going? I gotta tell you about this thing with my biz.

[e00060] time=10:43 am on 4 February, 2023 speaker=Gina type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Hey Jon! The store's doing great! It's a wild ride. How's the biz?
